---
// RangeKey — compact horizontal legend for the atlas's visual grammar.
// A strip (not a tall side panel) so the featured plate and grid stay near
// the top. Swatches echo the RangeBar / chart language used on the plates.
---
<section class="rangekey" aria-label="How to read these plates">
  <p class="rangekey-title smallcaps">How to read these plates</p>
  <ul class="rangekey-items">
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 44 14" class="rk-sw" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="0" y="4" width="30" height="6" rx="2" fill="var(--ink-soft)"/></svg>
      <span>Point estimate</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 44 14" class="rk-sw" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="4" width="26" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--ink-soft)" fill-opacity="0.85"/><rect x="20" y="2" width="1.6" height="10" fill="var(--ink)"/></svg>
      <span>Range, with central tick</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 44 14" class="rk-sw" aria-hidden="true"><defs><pattern id="rkhatch" width="4" height="4" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(45)"><rect width="2" height="4" fill="var(--ink-soft)" fill-opacity="0.5"/></pattern></defs><rect x="4" y="3" width="34" height="8" rx="3" fill="url(#rkhatch)" stroke="var(--ink-soft)" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>
      <span>Higher uncertainty</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 44 14" class="rk-sw" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="34" height="6" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-soft)" stroke-dasharray="3 2.5"/></svg>
      <span>Projection</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 18 18" class="rk-seal" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="7.5" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M9 4.5 v9 M4.5 9 h9" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>
      <span>Boundary-sensitive</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p class="rangekey-note">
    Most figures are ranges because the sources differ and the boundary matters.
    A range is not a weakness in the data; it is usually the honest shape of the answer.
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  .rangekey {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-3);
    margin: var(--space-6) auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .rangekey-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }
  .rangekey-items {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-3) var(--space-5);
  }
  .rangekey-items li {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .rk-sw { width: 44px; height: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .rk-seal { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .rangekey-note {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
